WithdrawAll_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when market not allowlisted for vault
│  └── it should revert with MarketNotAllowed
├── when no withdrawable position
│  └── it should revert with NoPosition
├── when withdrawable below credit
│  └── it should redeem only the withdrawable amount
└── when withdrawable at least credit
   ├── it should redeem the full credit
   ├── it should transfer loan token to the vault
   └── it should emit MidnightMarketAction withdraw
